{"parse": {"title": "AFH-03", "pageid": 105740, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/AFH-02\" title=\"AFH-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">AFH-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/AFH-04\" title=\"AFH-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">AFH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.95.AE.E9.BD.BF.E5.8A.A8.E7.89.A9\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"啮齿动物\">啮齿动物</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 啮齿动物</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Wisdom of the Rats</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>别<span class=\"color-value\"></span>忘<span class=\"color-value\"></span>记<span class=\"color-value\"></span>那<span class=\"color-value\"></span>些<span class=\"color-value\"></span>阴<span class=\"color-value\"></span>沟<span class=\"color-value\"></span>里<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>除<span class=\"color-value\"></span>了<span class=\"color-value\"></span>隐<span class=\"color-value\"></span>忍<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>第<span class=\"color-value\"></span>二<span class=\"color-value\"></span>种<span class=\"color-value\"></span>美<span class=\"color-value\"></span>德<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192403</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongshenchu_zhou\"><img alt=\"linzhongshenchu_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png/600px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png/900px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>粗糙的手掌紧紧按住了挣扎的女孩。喷吉躲在袖口里，嘶嘶作响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨尔曼少爷：</div><div>竟然把你的脏手伸进萨尔曼家族的口袋里……看来是一个来自摩卢旁卡村的神秘学家小贱种，你是怎么敢过来我的地界行窃的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨尔曼少爷：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-307110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-307110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-307110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>呸！不害臊的家伙！你们从大婶、大叔身上明晃晃抢走的东西可多得多了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-307110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-307110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-307110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>你们哄骗他们，把他们做的东西贬得一文不值，却倒手在各个村子用高价卖出！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-307110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-307110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-307110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>他们做的那些东西，都够买下好几间那样的破屋子了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-307110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-307110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-307110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>你们也睁开眼睛看看呀！大叔！难道你们真的不知道这些事吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她竭力地扭头，望向身后的大人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但他们面无表情地直视着她，无意理会，这只是一个无关乎自己生活的外来者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>正当的理由，合理的惩罚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨尔曼少爷：</div><div>……小贱种，那可都是我们合乎法规的生意，你大可向警察们控告。但别急，你得先为你的扒窃付出代价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨尔曼少爷：</div><div>把她的手摁死在地面上了吗，恰马尔？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-564801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-564801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-564801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">仆人Ⅰ：</div><div>是的，少爷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>坎吉拉的右手掌像砧板上的螃蟹，动弹不得。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>叮——刀子从手掌旁边插下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨尔曼少爷：</div><div>嘘～让咱们先从尾指开始，怎么样？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>刃像铡刀缓缓，缓缓朝着手指头的方向落下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“砰！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨尔曼少爷：</div><div>啊、啊啊——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伴随着震耳的枪声，刀子甩开在远处，持刀者的手掌流下潺潺鲜血。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有人从树丛中踏出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>呸……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>我还以为咱们干的事儿，够见不得人了……没想到除了过街老鼠，也有老鼠能戴上王冠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>萨尔曼少爷的仆从们一溜烟儿的工夫不见了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>坎吉拉匆忙拾起了掉在地上的刀子，好不容易才维持住了身体的平衡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>呵、呵哈……原来你没有跑掉？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>……握好刀子。把他脖子上的项链、手镯、戒指——还有，他的耳环不是挺显眼的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>全都割下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩愣住了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>你是不是忘记他怎么“招待”你的了？小不点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>别磨蹭了！还是你觉得从尸体上扒拉更方便？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>又一发子弹溅起灰尘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨尔曼少爷：</div><div>求求你，求求您……把这些都拿走！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人并没有等她出手，而是主动地、谄媚般地一股脑摘下了身上所有的值钱货，主动捧起给她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨尔曼少爷：</div><div>您都拿走吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>你还在愧疚什么？小不点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>这帮狗杂*的人类刚才想把你的手指给剁掉，你忘干净了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>别冲我喊，我知道！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>坎吉拉撇开脸，抵御着那种不适感，仍没有接过眼前这个卑躬屈膝的男人手上的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>你以为你在做错事吗？小不点，像你这样的孩子吃透了街头的苦，早该没有这种多余的怜悯心了吧……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>盗窃、抢劫，甚至于谋杀——不仅仅只是这里，而是这一整个世界……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>这个世界上每天都有人因为这样的事，被迫流离失所，因为食不果腹、因为肮脏的疫病，死在无人的角落里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>我的子弹能贯穿他的眉心，但相较起来，比起他们让人们在饥饿中失去尊严，直到奄奄一息，垂死挣扎……我已经算大发善心了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>道路尽头传来了密集的脚步声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-564801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-564801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-564801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">仆人Ⅰ：</div><div>老爷……！他们都在那儿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>啧……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他仿佛失去了最后的耐心，撤回丛林，没有任何招呼，转身就走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>等等我！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"hubian_huanghun\"><img alt=\"hubian_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>穿过密密层层的树林，他们得以抵达了人烟寂寥的深处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>哇……我的大篷车！原来你把它停得这么近？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>大篷车停在湖边，几只鸟儿在车顶憩息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>……如果放慢速度等你，我们可都得完蛋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他摸了摸口袋里的枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>反正有这东西，随时都能让他们乖乖听话。不如先留你下来当饵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>最重要的是，我们还得靠这破车开出这地方呢……任凭我们腿脚再好，也比不上他们这帮在这儿摸爬滚打几十年的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>可你为什么还要回来帮我……我是说，你本来可以一走了之的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>我只是不想自己的名头下……再被多栽赃一个死人。这是他们的地界，最不缺的就是假口供。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>上车吧，小不点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>我们得在太阳下山以前离开这里，驶上大马路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>呼……我知道有块儿地方……能把今晚先熬过去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>还有，听我一句忠告……别让怜悯心害了你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>怎么了？上车，蠢蛋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她站在黄昏下，一言不发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>片刻，她抬起了头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>我知道很多坏人，我也知道我是夏尔贾老师口中的坏孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>我会去辛哈大叔的园子里偷摘芒果，喜欢赚那些笨蛋游客的钱，扒走那些吊儿郎当的无赖们的口袋……我被抓到过，也挨过不少揍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>也许你说的对……但我……但我不认同，我不想赞同你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>我想，我情愿就这样，做个不好，但也不那么坏的人足够了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-565911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-565911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-565911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>啧……再见！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>大篷车头也不回地往大路上驶去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这次，坎吉拉及时反应了过来，犹如一条小狗般迅速地追了上去——接着一跃而上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-307110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-307110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-307110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>啊！下次——我一定也让你尝尝在后面追的滋味！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-hubian_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"hubian_ye\"><img alt=\"hubian_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/Cg-hubian_ye.png/600px-Cg-hubian_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/Cg-hubian_ye.png/900px-Cg-hubian_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/Cg-hubian_ye.png/1200px-Cg-hubian_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>泥地还没完全结块，车轮印是新的……他们还没开出去太远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅱ：</div><div>贾纳丹一直以来行事谨慎，这次却主动露出了狐狸尾巴……这可不太寻常，你确定不是某个相似的嫌疑犯吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅱ：</div><div>也许是那个蠢少爷拿通缉令报了个半真半假的案子，就为了能尽快拿回自己的损失……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>另一名警官带着顾虑，低声交谈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅱ：</div><div>至少，现在看上去就是平常的抢劫案，小案子……我们可以推给本地的警局，没必要在这儿浪费时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅱ：</div><div>一个携有巨款的杀人犯，就为了一点蝇头小利……暴露了自己的行踪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅱ：</div><div>这说得通吗？这……值得吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>车胎印前的警官直起了腰，走过来，拍了拍他的肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>这值得。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>也许，被带走的那个女孩身上更加……有利可图。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>只是咱们都还没看清楚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他揉搓着小胡子，似乎看见了即将上钩的鱼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>不会太久的，伙计。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>等老鼠逃到墙角，我们再放猫。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "AFH-03"}}